| ------------------- | ------------------ | ----------------------- |
| Declared in class?  | Yes                | Yes                     |
| Inside static?      | No                 | No                      |
| Needs object?       | Yes                | Yes                     |
| Access to static?   | Yes                | Yes                     |
| Access to instance? | Yes                | Yes                     |
| Stored in?          | Heap Memory        | Stack (when called)     |
| Called by?          | Object (`obj.var`) | Object (`obj.method()`) |

