| ------------------------------------------------- | --------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------- |
| Same name, different parameters                   | **Overloading** | ✅ Yes    | Compiler can distinguish by signature          |
| Same name, same parameters                        | ❌ Invalid       | ❌ No     | Duplicate method, compiler error               |
| Same name, same parameters, different return type | ❌ Invalid       | ❌ No     | Return type is not used to distinguish methods |

